  "release_notes": "Kenya climate-zone conditional-logistic DLNM review artifact, packaged from the modeller's 2026-08-14 source by pipelines/models/under_five_mortality/inference/package_kenya_model.R. Six fitted climate-zone blocks cover all 47 counties. Each block carries the temperature basis, coefficients and covariance for the Under_5_Mortality outcome only; the source's neonatal, post-neonatal, under-1 and child blocks are not included. The reference temperature is the block's reducedCrossPred centring, which the modelling script sets from median(Var_center) - it is not the MMT_crosspred artefact, which this release does not use. Not approved for activation; no batch path.",
